  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UYrNpKJN/images/28fbdff482a08cd94d0873f5bc26922efe5e5e11.png\" alt=\"堆叠方块\" width=\"332\" height=\"96\"></p>\n<p><strong>前所未有的储物体验，让容量最大化。</strong>将八个方块压缩为一个，例如原木、石块、下界岩和砖块，为你最重要的资源腾出宝贵的存储空间。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stacked-blocks/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=26.1&showAlphaFiles=hide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYDVgW.png\" alt=\"下载 26.1 更新\" width=\"217\" height=\"36\"></a></p>\n<h2>🧰 功能特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用拴绳将原木、石头、圆石、下界岩、西瓜、南瓜等方块堆叠起来。</li>\n<li>一个普通箱子最多可存放 13,824 件物品，为其他资源腾出空间。</li>\n<li>利用堆叠系统整理资源，打造更整洁、高效的存储方案。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🛠️ 扩展模组</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stacked-blocks-farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">堆叠方块：农夫乐事</a><br>\n<ul>\n<li>新增使用绳索制作可堆叠方块的功能。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stacked-blocks-supplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\">堆叠方块：附加组件</a><br>\n<ul>\n<li>可压缩灰烬砖、黑石瓦、泥灰等更多方块。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"正在攒钱买笔记本！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"支持作者\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐赠\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
